# waddle_controller (`apps/waddle_controller`)

- **Operator design language**: [`apps/waddle_controller/DESIGN.md`](../../apps/waddle_controller/DESIGN.md) (catalog lists, dialogs, schema forms; skills hold step-by-step checklists).
- **SOLID**: keep API clients (`src/api/`), persistence (`src/storage/`), server logic (`server/src/`), and pure helpers (`src/util/`, `src/auth/`) free of React; pages compose those modules. Do not embed fetch or `localStorage`/`sessionStorage` directly in page components when a storage or API helper already exists.
- **BFF**: optional Hono server in `server/`; SPA calls `/bff/v1/*` via `bffClient` with `credentials: 'include'`. Never store plaintext passwords in SQLite (Argon2 hashes only).
- **TDD**: add or extend a failing Vitest test (`src/**/*.test.ts`) before production changes in gated paths (`auth/`, `api/`, `storage/`, `util/*.ts`, `constants/`).
- **Coverage**: CI enforces **≥ 80%** line coverage on gated logic via [`tool/coverage_check.mjs`](../../apps/waddle_controller/tool/coverage_check.mjs); **90%** is the aspirational target (warn only). UI shells (`pages/`, `layout/`, `components/`, `context/`, `App.tsx`, `main.tsx`) are outside the floor until covered with React Testing Library.
- **Pre-commit / CI**: from `apps/waddle_controller`, run `npm run lint` (zero issues), `npm run test:coverage`, `npm run coverage:check`, and `npm run build`. CI also runs `npm ci` on a clean runner.
- **Pre-push** ([`waddle-prepush.mdc`](waddle-prepush.mdc)): git hook runs **`npm run build`** and **`npm run lint` only** — **not** `npm ci` (dev server locks native modules on Windows). After `package.json` / lockfile edits: stop `npm run dev`, run `npm ci` manually, then run the full gate from [`run-waddle-checks`](../skills/run-waddle-checks/SKILL.md).
- **Secrets**: never commit display API keys or session tokens; display sessions (API key + adopted role) live in `localStorage` per display id; when controller auth is enabled, keys are also encrypted in SQLite `user_displays`. Display base URLs in `localStorage` only. All display REST uses `/bff/v1/proxy/*`.
- **Role permissions**: keep [`src/auth/rolePermissions.ts`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/auth/rolePermissions.ts) in sync with `packages/waddle_shared/lib/auth/role_permissions.dart`.
- **Docs**: update [`apps/waddle_controller/README.md`](../../apps/waddle_controller/README.md) when operator workflows or env/proxy setup change.
- **Dialog submit UX**: any MUI `Dialog` (or modal) with **Save** / **Create** / **Add** / **Confirm** that calls an async API must use a submit flag (`saving` or `busy`) set **after** validation, disable the primary button while in-flight, change the label (`Saving…`, `Creating…`, `Confirming…`, etc.), call [`completeDialogSave`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/util/dialogSave.ts) (or equivalent close + refresh) on success, and keep the dialog open with an error `Alert` on failure. Use a **separate** `loading` flag for fetch-on-open — never reuse it for submit. Pass `disabled={saving}` to child config forms where supported. Details: [controller-dialog-submit](../skills/controller-dialog-submit/SKILL.md).
- **Catalog dialogs** (screens, overlays, ticker tapes): field order **label → description → type → shell fields → config**; no id field (server allocates from label); no raw `config_json` text areas; screen **type hidden on edit** (read-only label only); enum/options use human labels via `x-waddle-enum-labels`; categories/locations/symbols by display name or ticker, not internal ids; [`DurationInputField`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/components/DurationInputField.tsx) for seconds stored in DB. See [schema-config-form](../skills/schema-config-form/SKILL.md). Examples: [`ScreenDialog.tsx`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/components/screens/ScreenDialog.tsx), [`OverlaysPage.tsx`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/pages/OverlaysPage.tsx) (`OverlayDialog`), [`TickerPage.tsx`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/pages/TickerPage.tsx).
- **List / catalog pages**: use [`DataViewToolbar`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/components/dataView/DataViewToolbar.tsx) (card/table, reload, search, sort, optional order), [`useClientDataView`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/hooks/useClientDataView.ts) or [`useServerDataView`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/hooks/useServerDataView.ts), and [`DataViewPagination`](../../apps/waddle_controller/src/components/dataView/DataViewPagination.tsx). Details: [controller-data-view](../skills/controller-data-view/SKILL.md).
- **New overlay types**: full-stack checklist in [add-display-overlay](../skills/add-display-overlay/SKILL.md) (`waddle_shared` schema + `waddle_display` registry/widget + `OverlayConfigPanel` / icons).

See [`waddle-controller-tests.mdc`](waddle-controller-tests.mdc) for test-file conventions.
